  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/50c852693523e3828aa0fb0156fe6248e44abe9d</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/anomalyco/models.dev/commit/50c852693523e3828aa0fb0156fe6248e44abe9d"/>
    <title>
        feat(providers): add SambaNova provider (#9249)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-10-14T03:08:59Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45239701?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>rjuez00</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/rjuez00</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat(providers): add SambaNova provider (#9249)

SambaNova Cloud is an OpenAI-compatible inference provider at
https://api.sambanova.ai/v1 (env: SAMBANOVA_API_KEY).

Adds provider.toml (openai-compatible, docs link), the current purple
sling-mark logo (currentColor, no fixed dimensions), and six
override-only model entries with base_model plus cost, reasoning
controls, and verified deltas:

- DeepSeek-V3.1 / DeepSeek-V3.2: toggle via
  chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking (SambaNova text-generation docs
  + chat-completions OpenAPI + community examples)
- gemma-4-31B-it: toggle via chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking
  (dedicated SambaNova thinking-mode docs + staff example)
- gpt-oss-120b: effort low/medium/high via reasoning_effort on
  POST /v1/chat/completions (OpenAPI enum; matches chat-completions
  peers)
- MiniMax-M3: toggle via chat_template_kwargs passthrough
  (first-party + openrouter/novita-ai baseline); text-only override
  per supported-models note
- Meta-Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct: cost + max-output delta (non-reasoning)

Pricing (USD/MTok) per https://cloud.sambanova.ai/plans/pricing;
contexts/modalities per
https://docs.sambanova.ai/docs/en/models/sambacloud-models.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
